{"version":1,"key":"card:84","content":{"id":84,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"range.insertNode()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 既可以插入文本内容，也可以插入标签。它不会替换已选择的内容，而是在起点处插入一个节点。如果要替换，可以先删除在添加，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"range.deleteContents","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行删除。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const textNode = document.createTextNode('新内容');\nrange.deleteContents();\nrange.insertNode(textNode);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"5ae0ec46-5fe5-4471-b13d-ef280b82e420","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const mark = document.createElement('mark');\nmark.textContent = '新内容';\nrange.insertNode(mark);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"7a7ba245-d650-4b26-bd1b-ea31b19be342","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["DOM/选区"],"createTime":1689172731503,"updateTime":1743303640390,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640390}}